OL,3,GNEWSATribute to racer's 'determination
OL,4,Aand passion'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA racer killed in a crash during
OL,7,Fqualifying for the Manx Grand Prix has
OL,8,Fbeen praised for his "character,
OL,9,Fdetermination and passion".
OL,11,FSam Naughton, of Castletown on the Isle
OL,12,Fof Man, died in the crash at Doran's
OL,13,FBend, on the western section of the
OL,14,F37.7 mile (31km) Mountain Course, on
OL,15,FWednesday afternoon.
OL,17,FThe Andreas Racing Association (ARA),
OL,18,Fwhere the 37-year-old completed his
OL,19,Frace school training to allow him to
OL,20,Fbecome competitive, said it was deeply
OL,21,Fsaddened by his death.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,449,445,260,140,0,100
